              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Konye kebu Ekayuunan, lokejukakini yes anyoun kama ejai Papa, ŋes Emoyo Lokabeit, loebuni kama ejai Papa, itejenuni ŋol nukaŋ; ",
          "type": "text",
